/**
 * v2.2 creator-fee PAYEE (percolator-prog #587, merged as prog #644): wrapper tag 125 `SetCreatorFeePayee`,
 * the `CreatorFeePayeeV22` record (header kind 19), profile `p4_flags` bit 3, error 136
 * `CreatorFeePayeeInvalid`, and the routing rules tag 90 (`WithdrawCreatorFee`) and CloseSlab apply.
 *
 * Source of truth: percolator-prog `feat/v22-rc23-2026-10-22` @ `2b5dce8a`:
 * - `src/creator_fee_payee_v22.rs` (record, seed, bit, `claim_route`, `payee_update_allowed`, `creator_pot_orphaned`);
 * - `src/v16_program.rs` (`Instruction::SetCreatorFeePayee` decode/encode, `handle_set_creator_fee_payee`,
 *   `handle_withdraw_creator_fee` payee route + `read_bound_creator_fee_payee`, `rebook_orphaned_fee_legs_view`).
 * Byte parity: `test/creator-fee-payee-v22.test.ts` against `test/fixtures/creator-fee-payee-parity.json`, generated by
 * `scripts/creator-fee-payee-parity/sdk_587_parity.rs` from the real crate.
 *
 * What it does. A first-loss stake pool requires the asset's `asset_admin` burned to zero, and before #587 that made the
 * creator fee unclaimable for good (tag 90 needed the admin's signature; CloseSlab re-booked the pot to the protocol).
 * While `asset_admin` is LIVE it may now record a payee wallet (tag 125). After the burn the payee is frozen, and tag 90
 * for that asset is PERMISSIONLESS: anyone may send it, it pays only the payee's canonical associated token account for
 * the vault mint, and it takes the payee record as account `[6]`. CloseSlab does not re-book a pot that has a payee during
 * the payee's grace: it refuses (71 `CloseSlabFeesOutstanding`) until that pot is paid out. prog #651 (rc23 bbaa0e7b):
 * once `CREATOR_PAYEE_GRACE_SLOTS` (7 x 216,000) have passed since the engine's `resolved_slot` (Clock), CloseSlab re-books
 * an unpaid payee pot to the protocol leg like a no-payee pot (a payee whose ATA cannot receive cannot block the close for
 * ever). Tag 90 keeps paying the payee until that re-book; afterwards it answers 62 (over-claim).
 *
 * Nothing here is deployed.
 *
 * @module creator-fee-payee-v22
 */
